Additional third-party notice (AGPL)

The "Image Matting" feature integrates @imgly/background-removal
(https://github.com/imgly/background-removal-js), licensed under AGPL-3.0.
Distributors of binaries that include this feature must comply with AGPL-3.0.

The "Remove Watermark" feature uses the MI-GAN inpainting model
(https://github.com/Picsart-AI-Research/MI-GAN) via ONNX Runtime Web,
with the pipeline weights published at
https://huggingface.co/andraniksargsyan/migan (migan_pipeline_v2.onnx).
The browser inference approach is adapted from
https://github.com/lxfater/inpaint-web.
